      "parameters": {
        "content": "INSTAGRAM CONTENT DISCOVERY\n\n1. Replace Pipeline Config placeholders.\n2. This syncs Instagram media metadata into social_media_content.\n3. Run before the content metrics workflow so content UUIDs exist.\n4. It intentionally does not fetch per-post metrics.",
